.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="quotes" target="events"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="Every business table also has FK workspace_id → workspaces (not drawn, to keep the picture readable). Money is always an integer number of minor units. RLS on every table: rows are visible only to members of their workspace (is_member). quotes, quote_items, quote_events and workspace_members change only through Postgres functions. rate_limit_hits has no policy: service role only." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;fontColor=#5B6670;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="1780" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
